WEBVTT

00:00:03.533 --> 00:00:04.899
I <b>love shopping</b>.

00:00:06.446 --> 00:00:08.246
I <b>like going</b> to the movies.

00:00:09.729 --> 00:00:11.729
I <b>don’t mind getting</b> up early.

00:00:13.162 --> 00:00:15.096
I <b>don’t like doing</b> housework.

00:00:16.578 --> 00:00:18.258
I <b>hate driving</b> at night.